{"title":"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/5/a95ad6bd58c789f054a9e67e220461eed7593a91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(r+\\frac1r\\right)^2=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"113\" height=\"48\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/e/8de74f8b1e85598c66151eabec814ae8e400cf62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^3+\\frac1{r^3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"57\" height=\"37\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/8/948a8ca883e3a947625e449b18eee1d1f3dd13b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 3\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd6006cc9e8de1a9d57bc6608412c1c65e8fb60e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+\\frac1r=\\sqrt3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"93\" height=\"37\" />. Cubing this gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/d/d1db7ea2fe60cb00a805fb7bd111c4b2956b1ed6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^3+3r+\\frac3r+\\frac1{r^3}=3\\sqrt3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"192\" height=\"37\" />. But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/5/9252cb8a01bf1e66c51483cc8d8e07ac9a1a2830.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3r+\\frac3r=3\\left(r+\\frac1r\\right)=3\\sqrt3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"217\" height=\"43\" />, so subtracting this from the first equation gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/f/84f2f9cd5584cf058a7d6ed92d60a8be3bc3e2e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^3+\\frac1{r^3}=\\boxed{0\\textbf{ (C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"140\" height=\"38\" />. \n(Actually, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/8/068bbcce0c08da4f6dcd15e815ba1af41f06aa44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+\\frac1r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"42\" height=\"37\" /> could have been equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/0/050a01d442d0cab0e1e176b856051966d564a989.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\sqrt3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"18\" /> instead of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/9/c99f089046b752269e77100c333b11d8d72e5895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"21\" />, but this would have led to the same answer. Also, this answer implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/9/fd96829ad7d3983b4fdc2cca947d439b4448f067.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^6=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />, which means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a complex number.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitab